  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB PTDSSP  with major focus on energy access in Province 2 of Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Subregional Economic Cooperation - Power Transmission and Distribution System Strengthening Project (SASEC -PTDSSP). The main objective is to upgrade substation capacity to allow more hydropower (environmental friendly energy) into the grid and to have better access to clean energy and reduce imports of coal electricity. The project includes a measurable Gender Action Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
